A '''revitalisation potion''' is a potion that restores the player's drained stats and prayer. It can be made with 65 [[Herblore]] by using a [[buchu leaf]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having a [[stinkhorn mushroom]] in the inventory.

This potion is the standard variant of the revitalisation potions, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]].

